---
layout: base.njk
title: Stories
description: Reporting from the flightline — safety findings, profiles, and the people behind the operation.
permalink: /stories.html
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">ALL STORIES</div>
    <h1>Reporting from the flightline.</h1>
    <p>Safety findings, profiles, and the people behind the operation — updated as the reporting lands.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="strip">
    <span class="strip-label">ARCHIVE</span>
    <span class="strip-fill"></span>
    <span>{{ collections.articles.length }} STORIES</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="story-list">
    {% for article in collections.articles | reverse %}
    <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="story-row">
      <span class="story-date">{{ article.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
      <div>
        <div class="story-title">{{ article.data.title }}</div>
        <div class="story-dek">{{ article.data.dek }}</div>
      </div>
      <span class="story-tag">{{ article.data.tag }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
